        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.110.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 110.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now the point in what we are saying is this: we have such a high priest, one who is seated at the right hand of the throne of the Majesty in heaven, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a minister in the sanctuary and the true tent",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tabernacle",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " which is set up not by man but by the Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For every high priest is appointed to offer gifts and sacrifices; hence it is necessary for this priest also to have something to offer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now if he were on earth, he would not be a priest at all, since there are priests who offer gifts according to the law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 25.40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " They serve a copy and shadow of the heavenly sanctuary; for when Moses was about to erect the tent,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tabernacle",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " he was instructed by God, saying, “See that you make everything according to the pattern which was shown you on the mountain.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as it is, Christ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Greek",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " has obtained a ministry which is as much more excellent than the old as the covenant he mediates is better, since it is enacted on better promises. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if that first covenant had been faultless, there would have been no occasion for a second.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
